  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 350°F (180°C).",
    "In a medium bowl, whisk together flour, sugar, and baking powder.",
    "Add softened butter and mix until a dough forms.",
    "Press dough into a 9x9-inch baking dish.",
    "Arrange dates on top of the dough.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together eggs and vanilla extract.",
    "Pour egg mixture over the dates.",
    "Bake for 35-40 minutes or until golden brown.",
    "Remove from oven and let cool for 10 minutes.",
    "Cut into squares and serve."
